<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Vettisfossen via Vetti Gard — Hjelle–Vetti Gard–foot of Vettisfossen return [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>Walk from Hjelle in Utladalen along Folkevegen to Vetti Gard, then take the lower path to the foot of Vettisfossen. Return the same way, about 12.2 km overall. The upper viewing platform is separate. Confirm current markings and access on the last section, obey closures and keep clear of the waterfall impact zone; wet rock, loose ground and rockfall need care.

Route derived from ©Kartverket N50 Kartdata under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: source coordinates transformed to WGS84; walking course ordered and retraced for the return. No elevation assigned. Descriptive planning geometry, not navigation-grade.

